{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1172630363#10_2378277312","relevance":0,"reason":"This is a diabetes diet article where yogurt is only an incidental food suggestion; the meta-analysis evidence is about tree nuts and metabolic syndrome, not yogurt use.","learned":"The metabolic-syndrome meta-analysis query retrieved unrelated food evidence with incidental yogurt mentions."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"yogurt consumption\" \"health benefits\" review)","reason":"Search directly for review documents on yogurt consumption and health benefits, using wording from a cited highly relevant review while avoiding overly exact title constraints that previously only returned reference lists."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"yogurt consumption\" \"health benefits\" review)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1182911155#17_2150181762","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q136","rank":3,"snippet":"Flavored Brands of Greek Yogurt Contain Large Amounts of Sugar 2) May Cause Problems For People With Lactose Intolerance Final Thoughts \" , \"segment\": \"7) Potential Heart Benefits Numerous systematic reviews and meta-analyses suggest that fermented dairy products, such as Greek yogurt, may be good for the heart; A 2016 systematic review on dairy product consumption and the risk of cardiovascular disease demonstrated a favorable impact of fermented dairy on stroke risk and hypertension. Additionally, there was a neutral impact on cardiovascular risk ( 22 ). In a systematic review of 18 studies that followed 762,414 individuals for 8 to 26 years, <cover>yogurt consumption had no association with cardiovascular or stroke risk ( 23 ). In a systematic review of nine studies featuring 291,236 participants, a daily serving of >200 g yogurt was significantly associated with a lower risk of cardiovascular disease ( 24 ). Generally speaking, all extensive studies show neutral or favorable e\" , \"start_char\": 9163.000000 , \"title\": \"Greek Yogurt 101: Nutrition Facts and Health Benefits | </cover>Nutrition Advance\" , \"url\": \"https://www.nutritionadvance.com/greek-yogurt-nutrition-benefits/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_1464342827#18_2984495808","rank":1,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_1464342827#19_2984497414","rank":2,"relevance":1}]}}
